<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title><%= title %></title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/business.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/features.css"></head><body><%- include('../partials/admin_header') %><main class="studio-admin"><h1>Feature Visibility</h1><p>Turning a feature off hides it from customers but keeps all saved data and admin controls.</p><p>All features default to ON. For launch, keep Ready-to-Use Patterns and Online Classes on, then turn off any sections you are not ready to launch.</p><p>Paid Access closes new registrations and new payment orders; it does not make paid items free. Existing payment verification and receipts remain available when their section is enabled. Fees and catalog activity are still managed in Paid Access Settings.</p><% if(saved){ %><p role="status">Feature visibility saved. Refresh the customer website to see your changes.</p><% } %><form method="post" action="/admin/settings/features" class="feature-settings"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= learningCsrf %>"><% Object.entries(definitions).forEach(([key,label])=>{ %><label class="feature-row"><span><%= label %></span><span class="feature-switch"><input type="checkbox" role="switch" name="<%= key %>_enabled" <%= settings[key+'_enabled']?'checked':'' %>><span class="feature-slider" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="feature-state" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></label><% }) %><button class="fashion-button" type="submit">Save Feature Visibility</button></form></main></body></html>
